+Static validation passes (`cargo fmt --check`, `cargo check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, and diff checks). Native test executables compile but fail before assertions on this Windows host with `0xc0000139 STATUS_ENTRYPOINT_NOT_FOUND`; root cause is unconfirmed. Runtime validation is deferred to a known-good Windows environment. Do not mark Phase 04 complete, runtime-validated, or release-ready until those tests run.
+
 ## Key Insights

